WEBVTT

NOTE
This FMV depicts the arrival at Deling City at night, showcasing the grand metropolis in all its splendor. The camera sweeps across the cityscape revealing European-influenced architecture, wide boulevards, an enormous triumphal arch known as the Gateway, ornate buildings illuminated with golden lights, and bustling streets. The city is actively preparing for Sorceress Edea's grand parade.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
An elevated view of Deling City at night. The sprawling metropolis extends across the landscape below. Golden streetlights illuminate wide, straight boulevards. Grand buildings are lit with warm amber light. Elegant architecture dominates the cityscape.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The camera sweeps across the main avenue of Deling City. The street is lined with ornate lampposts casting pools of golden light. Trees provide shade along both sides. The street stretches toward a massive architectural landmark ahead.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The enormous Gateway arch comes into focus. This colossal triumphal arch stands at the heart of Deling City. The structure is beautifully proportioned, spanning the entire width of the main boulevard. Golden light illuminates its classical curves and architectural details.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The camera moves closer to the Gateway. The arch towers overhead, a monument to Galbadian architecture and power. Smaller buildings flank the base of the arch. The main boulevard continues beneath the arch toward the city center.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Automobiles drive along the main avenue beneath and beyond the Gateway. The vehicles are elegant and formal, befitting a grand city. The street is busy with nighttime traffic. People can be seen walking along the sidewalks.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The Presidential Residence appears in the distance beyond the Gateway arch. The palace is a sprawling complex of white marble and classical columns. It is lit dramatically against the night sky. Formal gardens surround the residence. The building exudes governmental authority and grandeur.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Parade preparations are visible throughout the city. Decorative banners hang from buildings. Platforms and reviewing stands are being constructed along the boulevard. Workers and soldiers arrange viewing areas. The city is being transformed into a showcase for the coming parade.
